  "Camera Access Required": "需要摄像头权限",
  "Please allow camera access in System Settings.": "请在系统设置中允许访问摄像头。",
  "Please allow camera access in System Settings to use the mirror feature.": "请在系统设置中允许访问摄像头，以使用取景镜。",
  "Enable Camera Access": "允许访问摄像头",
  "Boring Notch includes a mirror feature that lets you quickly check your appearance using your camera, right from the notch. Camera access is required only to show this live preview. You can turn the mirror feature on or off at any time in the app.": "墨岛 · InkNotch 的取景镜可在灵动岛内显示摄像头画面，方便你快速整理仪容。摄像头仅用于实时预览，你可以随时在设置中关闭此功能。",
  "Your camera is never used without your consent, and nothing is recorded or stored.": "摄像头仅在你同意后使用，画面不会被录制或保存。",
  "Enable Calendar Access": "允许访问日历",
  "Boring Notch can show all your upcoming events in one place. Access to your calendar is needed to display your schedule.": "墨岛 · InkNotch 可集中显示即将到来的日程。显示日程需要访问你的日历。",
  "Your calendar data is only used to show your events and is never shared.": "日历数据仅用于显示你的日程，不会被分享。",
  "Enable Reminders Access": "允许访问提醒事项",
  "Boring Notch can show your scheduled reminders alongside your calendar events. Access to Reminders is needed to display your reminders.": "墨岛 · InkNotch 可在日历日程旁显示已安排的提醒事项。此功能需要访问提醒事项。",
  "Your reminders data is only used to show your reminders and is never shared.": "提醒事项数据仅用于显示你的提醒，不会被分享。",
  "Enable Accessibility Access": "允许辅助功能访问",
  "Accessibility access is required to replace system notifications with the Boring Notch HUD. This allows the app to intercept media and brightness events to display custom HUD overlays.": "辅助功能权限可让 墨岛 · InkNotch 响应音量、屏幕亮度和键盘背光按键，并以自定义系统浮层显示调节提示。",
  "Accessibility access is used only to improve media and brightness notifications. No data is collected or shared.": "辅助功能权限仅用于改进媒体和亮度调节提示，不会收集或分享数据。",
